Patch summary:
Allow one video quality change every 2 s; each restarts the camera stream, and
changes faster than that can hang the external camera HAL.

diff --git a/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/aperture/CameraActivity.kt b/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/aperture/CameraActivity.kt
index 9068c5d..c3a53b2 100644
